message: "If you use this database, please cite it."
title: "Measured AI Video Model Database"
abstract: "Reproducible AI video generation records with full request payloads, hash-verified public artifacts, measured output properties, and documented failure modes. Models with verified local runs are separated from models not yet run; no quality scores or rankings are reported."
